{"id":"6809d72909d4cd1b","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-tm-equals-mu.md","title":"TM Computable Equals Mu-Recursive","display":"prop-tm-equals-mu — TM Computable Equals Mu-Recursive","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-tm-equals-mu","aliases":["88-prop-tm-equals-mu"],"display":"prop-tm-equals-mu — TM Computable Equals Mu-Recursive","depends_on":["[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-tm-equals-mu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-tm-equals-mu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-tm-equals-mu — TM Computable Equals Mu-Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> (Turing-computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\\)</span> (mu-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tm\\text{-}equals\\text{-}mu} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tm\\text{-}equals\\text{-}mu} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两侧是同一部分函数上的谓词，不能把图灵机对象类与函数类直接相等。</li>\n<li>Turing可计算 = mu-递归</li>\n<li>Church-Turing论题的数学基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}(f)$ (Turing-computability predicate, see [[88-df-computable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)$ (mu-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-mu-recursive]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tm\\text{-}equals\\text{-}mu} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)","display":true}],"bytes":906,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["bf4e721d88316525","64279ecae5246baf"]}